    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25736" root="ضرح" body-key="D">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انضرح</span></b>  <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, wide,</i> or <i>ample.</i>
(TA.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انضرح مَا بَيْنَ القَوْمِ</span> <i>The space
between the people was,</i> or <i>became, far-extending:</i>
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انضرج</span>. (As, S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>It split, slit,</i> or
<i>rent asunder</i> or <i>open:</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انضرج</span>. (TA.)

